<title>HONG KONG: Saehan Merchant sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Saehan Merchant sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger IBJ Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER SAEHAN MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON     3ML+50 BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH    07.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   23.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	     SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  07.NOV.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MANAGER  US$5 MLN+   36BP  ALL-IN  62 BP</p>
<p>	    CO-MANAGER	 US$2-4 MLN  30BP  ALL-IN  60 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS IBJ ASIA, KDB ASIA, LTCB ASIA AND WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 4039</p>
</text>
